<section class="inchy-process-step">
  <span class="inchy-process-step__number" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
  <header><p class="inchy-process-step__label">SOURCE</p><h2><span>QUALITY BEGINS</span><span>AT THE SOURCE.</span></h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-process-step__copy">
    <p>Before there is FORM1, there is a plant—and someone who tends it. INCHY begins with sacha inchi grown by small farmers in Colombia.</p>
    <p>Quality seed was too important to leave to chance. We helped establish a growers association and work directly with its members around a shared standard.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="inchy-process-step">
  <span class="inchy-process-step__number" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
  <header><p class="inchy-process-step__label">PRESS</p><h2><span>THE TRANSFORMATION</span><span>BEGINS WITH PURPOSE.</span></h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-process-step__copy">
    <p>The seed gives us the raw material. What follows is a controlled transformation developed through years of working with its particular character.</p>
    <p>Pressing is only the beginning. From there, our proprietary sequence shapes composition, flavour, texture and function.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="inchy-process-step">
  <span class="inchy-process-step__number" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
  <header><p class="inchy-process-step__label">REFINE</p><h2><span>TASTE. TEXTURE.</span><span>POSSIBILITY.</span></h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-process-step__copy">
    <p>Small process decisions create large differences in the finished experience. FORM1 is refined around three things that must work together.</p>
    <div class="inchy-process-details">
      <div><h3>FLAVOUR</h3><p>Working with the seed’s character, not disguising it.</p></div>
      <div><h3>TEXTURE</h3><p>Refining how FORM1 feels and behaves in preparation.</p></div>
      <div><h3>USE</h3><p>Creating a form designed to enter everyday food and drinks.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="inchy-process-step">
  <span class="inchy-process-step__number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
  <header><p class="inchy-process-step__label">PRESERVE</p><h2><span>PROTEIN + FIBER.</span><span>ONE FOOD ORIGIN.</span></h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-process-step__copy">
    <p>Protein and fiber begin together in sacha inchi. Both remain present in FORM1, carried from the same food origin into a new functional form.</p>
    <p>That relationship is not an afterthought. It is one of the principles around which our process was built.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="inchy-process-step inchy-process-step--result">
  <span class="inchy-process-step__number" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
  <header><p class="inchy-process-step__label">FORM1</p><h2><span>ONE SEED.</span><span>A FORM ALL OUR OWN.</span></h2></header>
  <div class="inchy-process-step__copy">
    <p>FORM1 is the result of the entire system: direct sourcing, years of process development and precise attention to what the finished ingredient must do.</p>
    <p>The seed is ancient. Its expression is unmistakably INCHY.</p>
